    <item>
      <title>Configuring AWS Cost Anomaly Detection</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/10-anomaly-detection/01-configure-cost-anomaly/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/10-anomaly-detection/01-configure-cost-anomaly/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;AWS Cost Anomaly Detection&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;AWS Cost Explorer&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;FinOps&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-duration&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;far fa-clock&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Estimated duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 15 mins&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;configuring-aws-cost-anomaly-detection&#34;&gt;Configuring AWS Cost Anomaly Detection&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;AWS Cost Anomaly Detection uses machine learning to identify unusual spend patterns. AWS documents that it uses Cost Explorer data, monitors net unblended cost, and can rank root causes across service, account, Region, and usage type.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-1--open-cost-anomaly-detection&#34;&gt;Step 1 — Open Cost Anomaly Detection&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Go to:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Billing and Cost Management → Cost Anomaly Detection&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Setting Up SNS &amp; Slack Alerts</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/10-anomaly-detection/02-sns-slack-alerts/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/CUDOS-with-AmazonQuick/10-anomaly-detection/02-sns-slack-alerts/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Amazon SNS&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Alerts&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;span class=&#34;aws-badge &#34;&gt;Slack&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-duration&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;far fa-clock&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Estimated duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 15 mins&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h1 id=&#34;setting-up-sns--slack-alerts&#34;&gt;Setting Up SNS &amp;amp; Slack Alerts&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;AWS Cost Anomaly Detection subscriptions can notify an Amazon SNS topic. AWS documentation supports mapping SNS notifications into Slack or Amazon Chime through &lt;strong&gt;Amazon Q Developer in chat applications&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;step-1--create-an-sns-topic&#34;&gt;Step 1 — Create an SNS topic&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Open:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Amazon SNS → Topics → Create topic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Use:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-text&#34; data-lang=&#34;text&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Type: Standard&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Name: finops-workshop-cost-anomalies&#xA;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&#34;aws-callout callout-note&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;p&gt;&lt;p&gt;📸 &lt;strong&gt;Screenshot placeholder — &lt;code&gt;10-06-sns-topic.png&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
